# I²C: writing and reading an EEPROM laid out by the engine (circuitBoard + autoroute, 2026-11-06): every part where the sheet
# puts it, the bench's nets on J1, the bottom poured with the ground; every connection laid, the checks clean.
pcb:i2c-eeprom-pcb("I²C: writing and reading an EEPROM — pcb") {
    meta {
        summary: "I²C: writing and reading an EEPROM laid out on a two-layer pcb by the engine: parts where the sheet puts them, the bench's nets on a header, a ground plane under it all."
